# Stop → tar these paths → start. The server saves on its stop signal (SIGINT from the image).
# Mods belong to the world: blocks and items a mod added are broken when the world is loaded
# without that mod, so the mods and their settings (ModConfig) are archived with the save.
# Not listed on purpose: data/Logs and the server's own backup folders (Backups, BackupSaves).
data/Saves
data/Playerdata
data/Mods
data/ModConfig
data/serverconfig.json
data/servermagicnumbers.json
